{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b2e1bedca5d22fa35d6c04fd3d073efcb48c2b0ab51fa73c49f6eb02ff45501",
      "text": "那个，冒昧打扰一下，请问您是苍井享介先生吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ba006751ca1432aa19b3b1017038781d2a5977d98940ea358e73036dabc194",
      "text": "诶？\n……是的，我是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76482942301f31ff6cb27d9119f5cc4f41bd5f3569b008a4e56ddc14ebbd9697",
      "text": "（这人是谁啊？看起来不像医院的人，\n难道是来打探悠介情况的记者……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8060805a18e86e6e38e67edf976689ba04d9b52aa9029382e0b7e35380f362d4",
      "text": "那个……请问我们在哪里见过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:144c06e32ec5cb1d4d4e8c5dd6134dcc716628fe4d53456e52406902c6789c04",
      "text": "非常抱歉，没能先向您自报家门。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ffbfcf512e6ab837b32886764733fa8b251b3b8d92103856982f2edb5509507",
      "text": "我在一家名叫315 Production的偶像事务所\n担任制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16fbadcc04372bb98cd519f683b5c44326073139afd88d5052e51bd176b0dc70",
      "text": "我和悠介先生约好了这个时间聊一聊，\n所以今天特地赶过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd39763da80c6f526e7f22ccb5f3674bde83c763b2a303ee82593554bd3c2fc8",
      "text": "（偶像事务所？为什么那种人会找悠介？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5754cf1ce6879e7968d27a1d81b91ce9bf428f2997b53521d99e7a2bbbb4ab70",
      "text": "（……真的约好了吗。\n算了，我也不能擅自把人赶走）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf5ddc3a7640445acade664f409f66b3547d2bb319fca61beba254c2345b3c52",
      "text": "那么，我们一起去悠介的病房吧。\n请走这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
